flowchart TD
    A[Customer signs in] --> B[View own transactions]
    B --> C[Filter or page through results]
    C --> D[Select transaction]
    D --> E{Transaction is owned and eligible?}
    E -- No --> F[Show non-disclosing error]
    E -- Yes --> G[Choose reason and add optional explanation]
    G --> H{Request is valid?}
    H -- No --> I[Show validation errors]
    H -- Yes --> J[Submit with idempotency key]
    J --> K[Record dispute and history]
    K --> L[Process simulated confirmation]
    L --> M[Show dispute and confirmation in history]